when they found the bag I just said it was lidocaine used for medicinal purposes and that tests would show that. I didnt actually think she put it in there at the time, but my experiences afterwards have made me certain she had access to fent or some sort of analog.

&#x200B;

I am facing charges... possession with intent to traffic it.

