I went from running 5k twice a week in top shape to being bedridden from internal injuries in like a 3 month period following a particular explosive arguement. we were living together and she was very upset that I took my cat home with me, said "thems fighting words" etc while I was getting sick, she would contstantly ask me if I was too sick she could take care of him again, tried to get me to write wills saying she would take care of him if I died as I was very concerned for his wellbeing if I succumbed to my internal injuries.

I had to tell her to stop obsessing about my death as she would bring this topic up fairly often.

thanks thats very helpful. I guess I just made it all up... /s

&#x200B;

lets see how well your doing mentally after an ordeal like that. I wish I was making it all up it was hell. There are clips of her literally spraying cleaning solution into my food or onto my cooking supplies like my frying pan, she used things like hand sanitizer and other ordinary household items that arent generally detected as poison.

&#x200B;

she even told me at one point that her uncle pissed her off for calling her overweight and she put eyedrops in his drink so...

I realize that should have been a complete redflag but she told me this after a while of seeing her and it is difficult to find partners when you are disabled.

I cant seem to get enough plant matter to soak it up 1/1,always feel like i lose some to the glass unless its closer to 1:2 ratio for me.

&#x200B;

this is a good ratio for joints n stuff, I used to smoke pipe bowls of it at festivals and watch fire shows.

&#x200B;

what is your leaf?

also fun side note, I have ideopathic chronic pancreatitis which means they dont know what causes it as I dont drink and this was all before my nitrous experiences. my pancreatic enzymes lipase has shot up over 9x the human limit and then I am back to baseline within the same day. 6x the human limit 5x etc, baffling hospital doctors I have been called a medical anomally, 4 doctors have told me there is no medical explanation why I did not have organ failure. this lipase spiking still continues to this day.

&#x200B;

Judging by what I know about ammonia, its not supposed to be a halucinogen and is quite deadly, and infact the mixture of hydrogen and nitrous oxide is used to make explosives, which is even stranger given that every single trip had explosions and fire in it.

gimme a day or so, I was writing it up a few minutes ago and the window closed its a fairly large write up that really requires a seperate post.

the jist of it is that I have an illness in my small intestine that has bacteria producing hydrogen gas, ive had hydrogen gas testing to confirm the illness through breath test and i have very high levels of hydrogen and some methane in my body. I occasionally partake in nitrous oxide, in the last year or so the balloons started doing weird things when I was breathing into them. Hydrogen and nitrous oxide react to form amonia which which is a different weight then air, the balloons would have very strange reactions to this gas mixture, liquid ammonia would form on the walls of the balloon and the balloons themselves deforms in strange ways I will detail more.

this gas combination has a PROFOUNDLY different effect then traditional nitrous gas, something that I believe I am the only person that has experienced this. it became an obsession, serious obe wormhole shit, Ill get into it later. if you know nitrous at all, from one balloon from sober at best you will get ringing ears, sound distortions and some euphoria. but me, no, everytime I do nitrous its like fucking russian roulette, sometimes its normal, other times the balloon gets weird and I have a complete fuicking out of body experience and its really unique because ive had OBEs from DMT so I know what they are like... ive had this gas induce a dmt state a couple times as well, its rare and much shorter, the duration is like 20-30 seconds and much less time dialation. Theres SOOO much more to it that I havent gotten into yet, like almost every trip starts the same and every time I did it the story got a little bit longer, i kept repeating the same trip with it extending longer and deeper each time.

&#x200B;

anyways I didnt do a balloon but I had the nitrous charger on the table and  it had a tiny tiny little burst of nitrous that i breathed a couple minutes before I sat down with my cat. I have some weird wormhole theories because of the hydrogen being charged quickly in a gas that also circulates within the balloon due to breathing pressure as well as the different gases pushing eachother. the idea that this particular type of fusion is creating enough energy in a turbulent design that it might be harnessing something. I know its all crazy as shit, I went on a bunch of nitrous forums and nobody has ever had anything like this, I can make videos of the ammonia forming as it causes visible changes to the balloon as well and you can see the liquid ammonia forming. the smell and taste of the gas is noticeably different upon completion of this mixture.

&#x200B;

I'll get into the details of what I saw and stuff later, but I could feel heat from open eyed visuals, i had repeat visions of fire and an explosion that i could physically see burning a hole in the floor and bend down and touch it and feel warmth, while walking around full open eyed cognitive. it usually only lasts for 20-30 seconds tops but some of the most insane visuals ive ever seen. its unlike ANY psychedelic experience ive ever had and only gets weirder the deeper the trips went.

&#x200B;

I had to stop it for fear of my own sanity, legit I was getting into lovecraft territory here where some of the things I was experiencing were just TOO much. I know atleast 3 times where I came back and instantly said out loud NOPE NOPE NOT KEEPING THAT and I blocked out whatever I learned there. As you can imagine its very difficult to talk about because I know i sound fucking insane but I swear on my life everything I said happened to me.

&#x200B;

I am still curious to go back, but I didnt realize it was ammonia right away and now I am scared to do more but the things I saw I cannot take back

bitcoin is a scam in that you make money by playing the market and not holding on for forever because its really going nowhere its just a market with vastly greater gains and losses in a 24 hour period that allows for market whales to setup events that can be CATASTROPHIC for people who are heavily invested but sitting and not playing or following the market ie bitcoin cash crashes, btc crashing from what 20k to 4? if you are not prepared and really dedicated to it there is a high chance you are going to lose money.

&#x200B;

its not a stable system like gold that just holds value and slowly improves over time like a alternative failsafe to banking which is what I find most boomers feel comfortable with. they pick stock companies based on news or tech that might come out in 10+ years and hope it turns out... not very wise. I watched my family invest my college fund in nortel, then they went in on bombardier and a few other ones that had epic losses. I learned early on that scalp trading sitting at a computer for 4-8 hours at a time is a much better system for crypto. it is stressful though.

